AArch64 SB+rel+acq
"Expected: Forbidden. Source: Coq memory/ARMBar.v, ARMBar.CrossCheck.sb_relacq_forbidden; memory/Litmus.v SB.arm_forbid (Mem.tex Delta1). UNVERIFIED -- run herd7"
{
0:X1=x; 0:X3=y;
1:X1=y; 1:X3=x;
}
